    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>1000</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br /><br />Work done against gravity mgh<br><br><math ><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#x00D7;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#x00D7;</mo><mn>9.8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>98</mn><mtext>&#x2009;</mtext><mi>J</mi></mrow></math><br><br>In lifting 1000 times <br><br><math><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo>&#x00D7;</mo><mn>98</mn></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>9.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><br />Fat burn with 20% efficiency <math><mo>=</mo><mn>3.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>0.2</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>7.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> per kg<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>7.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.289</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>12.89</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvaria